exec FastBusiness$Generate$DynamicImportChecking '@@table', '&Code;', '&ConfigDynamicVoucherType;', &ConfigDynamicType;, '@@sysDatabaseName', @field output, @r output, @$mode, @$errorCount output
if @$mode = 1 begin
  if @$errorCount = 0 begin select * from #errorTable order by id; return end;
end else begin
  &Error;
end

/* <flatten type="Javascript"> */
function upload$ProcessFailDetail(el, responseObject) {
  var f = el.form, a = responseObject, g = f.grid;
  var group, prev = '', cell, note, message, v = '', content = '';

  if (g._importForm) return;

  var wait = $get(f.get_id() + '_Wait');
  if (wait) wait._oldWaitHTML = ' ';
  f._busy = false;
  $func.hideWait(f.get_id());

  for (var i = 0; i < a.length; i++) {
    group = a[i][0];
    cell = a[i][1];
    message = a[i][2];
    note = a[i][3];

    if (group != prev) {
      prev = group;
      if (content != '') {
        v += '<div class="ime-content" style="display:none">' + content + '</div>';
        content = '';
      }
      v += '<div class="ime-header" onclick="onErrorGroupClick(this);"' + (i == 0 ? 'style="border-top:none"' : '') + '>' + message + '</div>';
    }
    content += (content != '' ? ', ' : '') + cell + note;
  }
  if (content != '') {
    v += '<div class="ime-content" style="display:none">' + content + '</div>';
    content = '';
  }

  g._currentContent = '<div style="overflow-y:auto;height:100%">' + v + '</div>';
  g._importForm = f;
  g.showForm('ImportModeErrorDetail');
}

function onErrorGroupClick(sender) {
  var content = sender.nextElementSibling, style = content.style, list = sender.classList, b = 'block', c = 'ime-active', v = style.display == b;

  if (v) list.remove(c);
    else list.add(c);
  style.display = (v ? 'none' : b);
}
/* </flatten> */

if @$usedEI = '1' begin
  set rowcount @$errorCount;
  insert into #errorTable(@@errorTableField) select @field, o.stt, 'OW01' from #owdata o join hddt01 c on c.stt_rec1 = o.stt_rec
   and not exists(select 1 from #errorTable e where e.field in (@field) and e.row = o.stt and e.message = 'OW01')
  set @$errorCount = @$errorCount - @@rowcount; set rowcount 0; if @$errorCount = 0 begin select * from #errorTable order by id; return end;
end

var or$ = f.getItem('status'), vr, ir;
if (!f._$handleStatusRemove) {
  for (ir = or$.options.length - 1; ir >= 0; ir--) {
    vr = or$.options[ir];
    if (vr.value == '*') {
      f._$handleStatusRemove = [vr];
      break;
    }
  }
}

if (f._action != 'View') {
  if (or$.value == '*') or$.value = f.grid._dvHandle;
  for (ir = or$.options.length - 1; ir >= 0; ir--) if (or$.options[ir].value == '*') {
    or$.remove(ir);
    f._$wasRemovedDeletion = true;
    break;
  }
} else f._$wasRemovedDeletion = null;

var r = $get('requestFormData');
if (!r) r = $func.requestFormData();
var query = '?type=TemplateUpload&' + String.format('&r={0}', Math.random());
r.action = $func.resolveClientUrl('~/AppHandler/ExportHandler.ashx' + query, g._baseUrl);
if (!$func.isIE) r.target = '_blank';
r.submit();
if (g._activeCell) g._activeCell.focus();
break;

